     Fallback NTP pool read by NtpTrustedTime when Settings.Global.NTP_SERVER
     is unset. The first-boot default for that setting is the same
     (def_lenos_ntp_server in LenosSettingsProviderOverlay), this resource only
     covers setting deletions and other code paths that read the array.
     Items must be in the form "ntp://<host>[:port]".
-->
